            "review_text": "haplo89\nAntwerp, Belgium2356 contributions\n1\nGreat pho, terrible (racist) service\nJul 2019 • Couples\nLet me start with the positives, the pho was great and so was the pork chop rice. The problem with pho 24 is the people who work there: they started by ordering the wrong things for us and since I only noticed after paying they wouldn't change it to what I asked for. Then we were forced out of our seats (nice at the window) because we had to make room for the Vietnamese customers! We were then relocated to the back of the restaurant where the floor was covered with 1cm of water. After refusing to sit there they did give us a slightly less bad seat. 3 minutes later the same thing happened when the next white tourist came in and sat down on a prime table... So pretty sure they are all a racist bunch!\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
