            "review_text": "368chiuv\nHong Kong, China150 contributions\n0\nThe soup taste good\nFeb 2019 • Solo\nI’m not eating beef, so I didn’t plan to go to have pho at the first place because I thought all pho contains beef, but it turns out not. They do have chicken pho, so I ordered one and it taste really good, I also drink all of the soup, which cost around vnd 49000. I also ordered a lime juice, cost vnd 19000, it’s a bit too much sugar inside, I prefer more sour. I think it is worth a taste for the pho, but the lime juice can just forgot about it.\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2019",
