            "review_title": "Review at Pho 24",
            "review_text": "Robert R\nBangkok, Thailand35 contributions\n0\nOnly reason not 5 is because it's too \"McD\" and not REAL local foods.\nJan 2019 • Couples\nIf you read my title you know what I mean? The soup is good I liked it. I didn't like the spring rolls I think they used mint leaves? Too strong. However the soups are good. This is just \"modern\" Pho and I prefer more real, local community restaurants when I travel to get a better local native taste. However it's not bad at all for still 4 stars. You can get bigger meals for cheaper if you go local.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 13, 2019",
