            "review_text": "Daniel P\nBangkok, Thailand489 contributions\n1\nas good as 5 years ago! still Slow food\nNov 2018 • Couples\nMy expats friends who have been more than 10 years in HCMC recommend me Pho 24 to eat. \n\nI was sceptical, it seems to be a fast food place. AND Indeed it is the opposite.\n\nIt is a delicious soup, made like traditional slow food.\nPrice. is around 50k to 60k (2 to 3 Usd) and my. recommendation is Fresh spring roles and chicken soup (you can take take a menu set option)\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2018",
